{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>韓國天團BLACKPINK成員Jennie昨日及今日接連出戰日本《SUMMER SONIC》音樂節，卻在台上遭遇服裝滑落與設備故障雙重打擊。網上瘋傳逾12,500,000次觀看的疑似走光片段尚未平息，她今日再因連環突發狀況淚灑舞台。這場備受矚目國際級演出最終走向令人始料不及失控局面。</p><p>Jennie音樂節連環遇險險春光乍洩</p><p>她以白色內衣配搭低腰牛仔褲狂舞時，上衣意外位移引發疑似露點危機。她在台上演繹多首名曲期間，不僅咪高峰突然失靈，身上比堅尼戰衣更頻頻滑落，迫使她多次背向觀眾匆忙整理。現場畫面清晰可見她緊咬嘴唇且雙手發震，強忍淚水努力維持鎮定，最終卻因情緒與設備雙重崩潰未能完成原定歌單中最後兩首曲目。</p><p>哽咽致歉揭露酷熱天氣惹禍內幕</p><p>經歷接二連三突發狀況後，她勉強重整狀態重返舞台含淚謝幕，並親自向台下數以萬計觀眾低頭致歉。她緊握咪高峰向樂迷解釋：「對不起！我今天的服裝出了點小問題，沒想到天氣這麼熱，出這麼多汗。」以親自發聲試圖平息現場擔憂情緒。截至目前為止，所屬經紀公司仍未對網上瘋傳片段真偽以及連日來演唱會管理疏失發表任何官方正式立場。</p><p>SUMMERSONIC大膽造型藏致敬密碼</p><p>今次惹來極大爭議性感戰袍其實大有來頭，設計團隊特意讓她大膽展現「Sagging」低腰風格，旨在向1993年經典伸展台時尚美學致敬。不過高強度編舞動作卻令這套精心設計服裝成為高風險陷阱，加上早前她在波蘭大型戶外騷亦曾發生類似服裝滑落事件，令外界質疑造型團隊未有吸取教訓。目前於各大社交平台錄得超過12,500,000次點擊且被轉發逾9,000次疑似露點短片，更被不少海外粉絲質疑是利用Deepfake技術惡意偽造。</p><p>網民激烈交鋒護航聲浪力壓酸民</p><p>疑似走光影片曝光後隨即引爆全球輿論戰，零星網民藉機大開黃腔嘲諷，但瞬間遭到大批理智粉絲以洗版式留言圍剿。無數鐵粉在各大平台焦急發聲護航，直斥造假者行為卑劣，紛紛留言反擊：「這不是真的吧？拜託告訴我是假的！」以及「一眼就知道是P的啦，有人惡意合成的！」。面對偶像接連受挫，歌迷亦持續在各大論壇發文安慰，嚴厲喝止散播未經證實惡意影像並呼籲各界給予女方尊重。</p><figure><img alt=\"bkn-20260816230528737-0816_00862_001_08b.jpg/raw\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178695727984791512_15340663636a82cde071752.jpg\"/><figcaption>bkn-20260816230528737-0816_00862_001_08b.jpg/raw</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"bkn-20260816230528737-0816_00862_001_09b.jpg/raw\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178695728121516800_6046593946a82cde178a3d.jpg\"/><figcaption>bkn-20260816230528737-0816_00862_001_09b.jpg/raw</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"bkn-20260816230528737-0816_00862_001_10b.jpg/raw\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178695728201743289_18711628896a82cde30384d.jpg\"/><figcaption>bkn-20260816230528737-0816_00862_001_10b.jpg/raw</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"bkn-20260816230528737-0816_00862_001_11b.jpg/raw\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178695728441184881_14422954576a82cde4c3a75.jpg\"/><figcaption>bkn-20260816230528737-0816_00862_001_11b.jpg/raw</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"bkn-20260816230528737-0816_00862_001_12b.jpg/raw\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178695728559057000_2151929806a82cde647b77.jpg\"/><figcaption>bkn-20260816230528737-0816_00862_001_12b.jpg/raw</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"jennierubyjane_1786954265_3965580909950014388_7140177628.jpg/raw\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/17869572869614320_7279134966a82cde74627f.jpg\"/><figcaption>jennierubyjane_1786954265_3965580909950014388_7140177628.jpg/raw</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"jennierubyjane_1786954265_3965580917390917729_7140177628.jpg/raw\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178695728815679906_5025907916a82cde894f76.jpg\"/><figcaption>jennierubyjane_1786954265_3965580917390917729_7140177628.jpg/raw</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"jennierubyjane_1786954265_3965580927977366881_7140177628.jpg/raw\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178695728945857431_14289769156a82cde9c4811.jpg\"/><figcaption>jennierubyjane_1786954265_3965580927977366881_7140177628.jpg/raw</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"jennierubyjane_1786954265_3965580928279236139_7140177628.jpg/raw\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178695729067198510_6925630746a82cdeb40f77.jpg\"/><figcaption>jennierubyjane_1786954265_3965580928279236139_7140177628.jpg/raw</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"jennierubyjane_1786954265_3965580928799254703_7140177628.jpg/raw\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178695729227125945_5117179526a82cdecc2a9e.jpg\"/><figcaption>jennierubyjane_1786954265_3965580928799254703_7140177628.jpg/raw</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"jennierubyjane_1786954265_3965580934000330317_7140177628.jpg/raw\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178695729440042079_2534788886a82cdeecfd6f.jpg\"/><figcaption>jennierubyjane_1786954265_3965580934000330317_7140177628.jpg/raw</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"jennierubyjane_1786954265_3965581001209793242_7140177628.jpg/raw\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178695729572754161_3304251256a82cdf005000.jpg\"/><figcaption>jennierubyjane_1786954265_3965581001209793242_7140177628.jpg/raw</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"jennierubyjane_1786954265_3965581008700869543_7140177628.jpg/raw\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/17869572968644425_6046481466a82cdf1c159e.jpg\"/><figcaption>jennierubyjane_1786954265_3965581008700869543_7140177628.jpg/raw</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"jennierubyjane_1786954265_3965581010261042442_7140177628.jpg/raw\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178695729885243303_20573475296a82cdf34469a.jpg\"/><figcaption>jennierubyjane_1786954265_3965581010261042442_7140177628.jpg/raw</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"jennierubyjane_1786853401_3964734716357582854_7140177628.jpg/raw\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178695730019718154_20386086406a82cdf47727c.jpg\"/><figcaption>jennierubyjane_1786853401_3964734716357582854_7140177628.jpg/raw</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"jennierubyjane_1786853401_3964734749937194300_7140177628.jpg/raw\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178695730183496409_10117916996a82cdf6e8479.jpg\"/><figcaption>jennierubyjane_1786853401_3964734749937194300_7140177628.jpg/raw</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"jennierubyjane_1786853401_3964734716625899682_7140177628.jpg/raw\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178695730979369683_20704700646a82cdfe2869a.jpg\"/><figcaption>jennierubyjane_1786853401_3964734716625899682_7140177628.jpg/raw</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"jennierubyjane_1786853401_3964734739048597691_7140177628.png/raw\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178695731156275018_10832546696a82ce00163f4.png\"/><figcaption>jennierubyjane_1786853401_3964734739048597691_7140177628.png/raw</figcaption></figure><p>還有什麼演唱會消息？</p><p>無論是本地歌手還是外地歌手都即將在香港舉行演唱會，即睇： 演唱會時間表及購票資訊 ，包括 MIRROR演唱會門票兌換安排 、 容祖兒 、 鄭秀文 、 張學友 、 鄭中基 、 溫拿 、 羅志祥 等。</p><p>除了演唱會，還有什麼消閒娛樂活動？</p><p>喜愛宅在家的話，觀看 Netflix劇集 和 BL劇 最好不過。如果喜歡外出走走的你，也可到這些 室內好去處 室內遊樂場、溜冰場、自助烘焙店等盡玩室內活動。想要親親大自然，也可到離島走一走，即睇： 離島行程攻略 或是行山，這些 行山好去處 路線簡易，新手也適合。</p><p>Tags : 女團走光 韓國娛樂 音樂節</p><p>資料或影片來源： 原文刊於新假期</p><p>Aug 17 2026</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-17T10:10:14.757291+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":2293,"images":18,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none"}}